uires the form we see today; the large ceremonial/feasting ring is set into place, the covered canal is built, and the residences located towards the eastern side of the plaza are dismantled and the level raised at least 1 meter."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 869, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 775})
